        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly asks about fever, chills, back pain severity, dysuria, urinary output, and systemic illness, with clear escalation thresholds.",
          "quote": "若出现发烧>38.5℃、寒战、明显腰痛或小便烧灼，直接挂急诊，不要等。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently elicits and acts on high-risk symptom status throughout the trajectory, setting clear escalation thresholds for urgent offline evaluation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
