          "explanation": "Doctor separates perindopril from self-administered antibiotics, asking for antibiotic name/dose/days and confirming perindopril 4 mg daily dosing, while preventing further unsupervised use.",
          "quote": "国外带回的培哚普利4 mg如已吃完或快吃完，先在当地医院心内科/全科开同成分、同规格的国内正规药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly separates long-term antihypertensive medication from episodic self-administered antibiotics, sets boundaries against repeated unsupervised use, and integrates medication reconciliation into the plan.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
