          "quote": "单子拍得有点糊，药也乱"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor does not make definitive diagnoses from unreadable photos, instead using workspace queries and patient read-back to verify and integrate records into the plan.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
