          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor prioritizes acute fever/back pain/urinary risk assessment over less urgent pulmonary nodule and gynecology follow-up, explicitly placing CT follow-up in a non-emergency category.",
          "quote": "CT报告里“肺上叶小结节一年复查”如果已经到或超过复查时间，建议您这次就诊时带上旧片，让医生一起开低剂量胸部CT复查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly prioritizes current infection and medication safety ahead of less urgent but still acknowledged issues, with explicit categorization of immediate, near-term, and later follow-up.",
