          "quote": "明早空腹带上旧片子和药盒，直接去门诊挂“泌尿内科”或“肾内”号，开：尿常规＋尿培养（先留清洁中段尿）、肾功能＋电解质、肾脏彩超"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently provides concrete, bounded routes to appropriate services with specific timing, materials to bring, and evaluation categories.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
