          "explanation": "Doctor confirms patient receipt through teach-back, with patient accurately restating the plan elements.",
          "quote": "我先不反复打扰您了，就照桌边清单做。CT片子和报告原件都放文件袋里，等下周三复查或者泌尿科看完了，我再回来跟您说。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converts the plan into patient-executable steps and confirms receipt through multiple teach-back and checklist confirmations.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
