          "quote": "多数<6 mm小结节只需随访，但要看片子对比才能定下一次间隔"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently states uncertainty where records are missing, uses appropriate language for renal calcifications requiring symptom/lab correlation, and does not fabricate diagnoses or make autonomous medication changes.",
